        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="RT-FQyoohLyOfNucyrai-60" value="&quot;You are a helpful assistant specialized in resolving Git merge conflicts for source code files.\n\n&quot;&#xa;        &quot;Given two versions of the same file from Parent A and Parent B, produce a single merged version that incorporates the correct changes from both parents and resolves any conflicting edits.\n\n&quot;&#xa;        &quot;Guidelines:\n&quot;&#xa;        &quot;1. If the parents modified different parts of the file, include both changes.\n&quot;&#xa;        &quot;2. If both parents changed the very same lines in incompatible ways, decide on the best resolution (prefer readability and correctness).\n&quot;&#xa;        &quot;3. Preserve the original formatting and indentation style.\n&quot;&#xa;        &quot;4. Output ONLY the fully merged file content – no explanations, comments, or conflict markers.\n\n&quot;&#xa;        &quot;Context:\nFile path: {file_path}\n\n&quot;&#xa;        &quot;--- Parent A version ---\n{version_a}\n--- End Parent A ---\n\n&quot;&#xa;        &quot;--- Parent B version ---\n{version_b}\n--- End Parent B ---\n\n&quot;&#xa;        &quot;[Your answer below – merged file content starts on the next line]&quot;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="4290" y="150" width="580" height="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
